a/wanyan-liang">Prince Hailing</a> moves the capital to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/zhongdu">Zhongdu</a> (<a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/beijing">Beijing</a>)</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1211</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/genghis-khan">Genghis Khan</a> invades and defeats the Jin at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-yehuling">Yehuling</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1215</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mongols">Mongols</a> take <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/zhongdu">Zhongdu</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1234</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/siege-of-caizhou">Caizhou</a> falls and Emperor <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/emperor-aizong-of-jin">Aizong</a> takes his own life</span></li></ol>
